WEBVTT

01:30.410 --> 01:34.880
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.250 --> 01:37.670
[Episode 7]

01:38.000 --> 01:38.759
I'll take them all.

01:38.759 --> 01:39.710
Please deliver them
to the magistrate's office.

01:39.710 --> 01:40.390
No problem.

01:41.560 --> 01:42.310
You are...

01:50.990 --> 01:52.320
What are you doing here?

01:52.870 --> 01:55.560
Why are you and the Feiyu Guard
going to Misty Forest again?

01:55.560 --> 01:57.090
It's none of your business.

01:58.610 --> 02:00.830
Protecting the demons
is my responsibility.

02:00.830 --> 02:01.470
You are

02:01.930 --> 02:02.730
no exception.

02:04.350 --> 02:05.380
Who do you think you are?

02:05.380 --> 02:06.230
Coming and going

02:06.230 --> 02:07.070
as you please.

02:07.070 --> 02:08.630
I, Xiao Yao, have been wandering
the martial world for a long time.

02:08.630 --> 02:09.820
I don't need anyone's protection.

02:09.820 --> 02:10.500
Let me go!

02:11.260 --> 02:11.850
Xiao Yao.

02:13.070 --> 02:14.130
Stop making a fuss.

02:15.100 --> 02:16.100
Me? Making a fuss?

02:17.350 --> 02:18.030
Fine.

02:18.030 --> 02:19.630
I'm the one making a fuss.
It's all my fault.

02:19.630 --> 02:20.890
Can you release me now?

02:20.890 --> 02:22.260
It's really dangerous
for you to go in alone.

02:22.260 --> 02:23.540
It's none of your business!

02:23.540 --> 02:24.210
Let go!

02:24.660 --> 02:25.190
Xiao Yao.

02:26.820 --> 02:29.030
The Misty Forest
is the mountain elves' lair.

02:29.030 --> 02:31.579
That masked man
is the rare thousand-year mountain elf.

02:31.579 --> 02:32.540
He is neither human nor demon,

02:32.540 --> 02:34.540
existing outside the Three Realms.

02:34.660 --> 02:36.190
You can't handle him alone.

02:37.860 --> 02:38.720
A mountain elf?

02:39.660 --> 02:40.660
Come back with me.

02:40.660 --> 02:42.120
I'll explain everything.

02:43.770 --> 02:44.650
My Lord.

02:45.230 --> 02:46.690
Do you still want the rope?

02:48.140 --> 02:49.820
Where's that girl from just now?

02:49.820 --> 02:50.980
She left with that gentleman.

02:50.980 --> 02:51.640
Gentleman?

02:53.260 --> 02:54.420
What kind of gentleman?

02:54.420 --> 02:55.480
How was he dressed?

02:56.140 --> 02:57.170
He was tall

02:57.579 --> 02:58.620
with fair skin.

03:01.980 --> 03:04.390
Tan'er, the great demon
is right before us.

03:04.540 --> 03:05.790
Can't you sense it?

03:07.140 --> 03:08.230
Twenty years ago,

03:08.820 --> 03:10.950
the Hefeng Tribe rose to power
in the Northern Prairie.

03:10.950 --> 03:13.470
The tribe leader,
imitating the Emperor of Tiansheng,

03:13.470 --> 03:16.180
sent a fleet to search
for the Penglang Celestial Mountain.

03:16.180 --> 03:18.030
But the fleet encountered a storm at sea.

03:18.030 --> 03:19.070
Only one small boat remained,

03:19.070 --> 03:20.270
drifting aimlessly.

03:20.950 --> 03:22.680
By chance, it reached Penglang

03:22.950 --> 03:24.260
and found the Yuli Spring.

03:24.260 --> 03:25.260
The crew on the boat

03:25.260 --> 03:26.980
were all loyal warriors
of the Hefeng Tribe,

03:26.980 --> 03:28.100
extremely faithful,

03:28.100 --> 03:29.630
who dared not drink it themselves

03:29.630 --> 03:31.540
but wanted to bring it back
to their leader.

03:31.540 --> 03:33.260
Little did they know
that on their way back,

03:33.260 --> 03:35.100
they encountered another storm,

03:35.100 --> 03:37.579
which blew their boat
into Tiansheng territory.

03:37.579 --> 03:38.510
The Emperor of Tiansheng

03:38.510 --> 03:40.510
wouldn't miss such an opportunity.

03:40.540 --> 03:43.870
He immediately mobilized the Feiyu Guard
and various sects

03:44.579 --> 03:45.820
to seize

03:46.540 --> 03:48.140
the Yuli Spring at all costs.

04:07.310 --> 04:08.840
You have all been deceived!

04:08.950 --> 04:09.880
The spring water

04:10.230 --> 04:11.490
is the tears of a demon,

04:11.950 --> 04:14.660
drawing out the raw essence
of human nature and desire.

04:14.660 --> 04:16.250
What you call immortality

04:16.779 --> 04:17.519
is

04:17.990 --> 04:20.000
an eternity of suffering!

05:32.470 --> 05:34.400
The Hefeng Tribe was slaughtered.

05:35.820 --> 05:37.820
But one young warrior survived.

05:39.340 --> 05:40.409
For revenge,

05:41.070 --> 05:44.130
he swallowed mud mixed with water
from the Yuli Spring,

05:44.510 --> 05:46.190
prayed to demons for power,

05:48.020 --> 05:50.080
and transformed into a mountain elf.

05:55.170 --> 05:56.950
Why do you know so much about this

05:56.950 --> 05:59.080
as if you've seen it with your own eyes?

06:03.040 --> 06:04.950
It's all recorded in the Baize Drawings.

06:04.950 --> 06:07.010
You didn't do your research properly

06:07.220 --> 06:08.820
and you have the nerve to ask?

06:09.730 --> 06:10.200
[Taotie]

06:10.210 --> 06:13.390
[Mountain Elf]

06:11.340 --> 06:12.340
He killed many people

06:12.340 --> 06:13.310
for revenge.

06:14.340 --> 06:16.380
Many sect leaders died by his hand.

06:17.300 --> 06:19.010
He has a blood feud with humans

06:19.030 --> 06:21.070
but nothing with demons.

06:22.820 --> 06:25.070
Later, all major sects
were forced to unite.

06:25.070 --> 06:27.040
And rumors about the elf
gradually disappeared.

06:27.040 --> 06:28.300
We thought he was dead.

06:29.220 --> 06:31.510
Unexpectedly,
he's been hiding in the Misty Forest

06:31.510 --> 06:32.570
living eternally.

06:34.340 --> 06:35.880
All his loved ones are dead.

06:36.380 --> 06:38.120
What's the use of immortality?

06:39.070 --> 06:40.670
Each day must feel like a year to him,

06:40.670 --> 06:41.870
unbearably painful.

06:42.780 --> 06:44.190
It's not surprising that he kidnapped

06:44.190 --> 06:45.900
the Qionghua sect leader's daughter.

06:45.900 --> 06:48.560
This is the consequence
of humans' own actions.

06:49.110 --> 06:49.740
No.

06:50.190 --> 06:51.630
The grievances of the previous generation

06:51.630 --> 06:52.820
shouldn't fall on the next.

06:52.820 --> 06:54.430
No matter how deep the elf's hatred is,

06:54.430 --> 06:56.290
that girl shouldn't be involved.

06:56.340 --> 06:58.140
This matter doesn't concern demons.

06:58.140 --> 06:59.990
Demons never enter
the Misty Forest either.

06:59.990 --> 07:01.220
Even if someone needs to be rescued,

07:01.220 --> 07:02.700
humans should save their own.

07:02.700 --> 07:03.870
Xiao Mu, be quiet!

07:04.260 --> 07:05.140
My Lord, I...

07:10.750 --> 07:11.310
My Lord.

07:17.260 --> 07:18.920
My Lord, you really cannot go.

07:19.240 --> 07:20.900
If it's about Luoluo and Dali,

07:21.020 --> 07:22.630
all the more reason
you don't need to get involved.

07:22.630 --> 07:24.580
I can resolve this
with one trip to Pingjiang.

07:24.580 --> 07:25.830
A mere mountain elf

07:25.900 --> 07:26.900
is no match for me.

07:27.260 --> 07:28.780
Why are you trying so hard to stop me?

07:28.780 --> 07:30.040
All the demon subjects

07:30.160 --> 07:32.190
hope you can become powerful again,

07:32.380 --> 07:34.310
leading us to find the Yuli Spring.

07:34.390 --> 07:35.650
If you go to save humans

07:36.070 --> 07:37.470
at this critical moment,

07:37.950 --> 07:40.140
do you really want Hei Wu
to get the Demon Heart?

07:40.140 --> 07:42.400
Luoluo and Dali are trapped among humans

07:42.640 --> 07:43.860
in danger because of this.

07:43.860 --> 07:45.170
If we abandon them,

07:45.430 --> 07:46.990
how can we restore the Demon Heart?

07:46.990 --> 07:47.310
No.

07:47.550 --> 07:48.810
My Lord, you cannot go.

07:49.490 --> 07:50.130
No, no!

07:52.110 --> 07:52.750
My Lord!

07:53.909 --> 07:54.800
You cannot go!

07:54.830 --> 07:55.360
Xiao Yao.

08:04.910 --> 08:05.570
Step aside.

08:09.260 --> 08:10.070
If you won't save them,

08:10.070 --> 08:11.110
I'll go myself.

08:11.110 --> 08:11.950
You don't need to worry about me.

08:11.950 --> 08:12.820
I have my own plan.

08:12.820 --> 08:13.480
Move aside.

08:13.630 --> 08:14.630
I won't worry about you.

08:14.630 --> 08:16.030
I'll listen to your plan.

08:20.130 --> 08:21.590
I'll do whatever you say.

08:44.670 --> 08:46.890
What's in this bag?

08:47.550 --> 08:48.810
The smell is so strong.

08:57.460 --> 08:58.320
It's so stinky.

08:58.430 --> 09:00.030
Of course dried fish stinks.

09:00.930 --> 09:02.420
But it can lure cats out.

09:02.970 --> 09:04.610
We can bring the leftovers back
for Xiao Ming.

09:04.610 --> 09:05.740
He'll like them too.

09:06.100 --> 09:06.830
Are you sure?

09:11.270 --> 09:12.700
What about this hemp rope?

09:12.700 --> 09:13.570
What's it for?

09:14.620 --> 09:15.910
We can't go in together

09:15.910 --> 09:17.460
so we don't frighten the girl.

09:17.460 --> 09:18.340
I'll go in first.

09:18.340 --> 09:19.220
If I encounter any danger,

09:19.220 --> 09:20.550
I'll tug the rope twice.

09:20.700 --> 09:21.740
If I don't pull the rope,

09:21.740 --> 09:22.740
it means it's safe,

09:22.740 --> 09:24.340
and you can let the rope down.

09:25.620 --> 09:26.150
Xiao Yao.

09:27.220 --> 09:27.870
Why don't

09:28.030 --> 09:29.160
you wait for me here?

09:29.390 --> 09:30.990
I'll go bring that girl back.

09:31.860 --> 09:33.030
How will you bring her?

09:33.030 --> 09:34.560
Kidnap her like the elf did?

09:36.070 --> 09:36.700
Fine.

09:37.550 --> 09:38.700
I won't say anything more.

09:38.700 --> 09:40.030
Let's follow your plan.

09:40.820 --> 09:42.220
That's our only option anyway.

09:42.220 --> 09:43.580
Since the jade pendant was taken back,

09:43.580 --> 09:45.910
we can't use the summoning spell anymore.

09:52.790 --> 09:53.450
Let me do it.

09:57.740 --> 09:58.670
Don't tie it too loose,

09:58.670 --> 09:59.800
or it might fall off.

10:03.460 --> 10:04.500
Don't tie it too tight either.

10:04.500 --> 10:05.460
I'm afraid of being strangled.

10:05.460 --> 10:07.460
I haven't even started tying it yet.

10:07.670 --> 10:08.470
Then hurry up.

10:10.500 --> 10:11.150
Done.

10:16.460 --> 10:16.990
Xiao Yao!

10:20.620 --> 10:21.420
Be careful.

10:39.580 --> 10:40.150
Kitty.

10:41.830 --> 10:43.090
Little Kitty.

11:17.700 --> 11:18.310
Xiao Yao!

11:42.390 --> 11:44.070
It loves these dried fish the most.

11:44.070 --> 11:45.270
You can feed it these.

11:46.220 --> 11:47.860
Nobody ever comes here,

11:47.980 --> 11:49.030
it's so lonely.

11:49.190 --> 11:50.850
It's so nice that you're here.

11:53.270 --> 11:53.820
Xiao Yao.

11:57.030 --> 11:58.210
Why did you come in?

11:58.500 --> 12:00.630
Weren't you supposed to wait outside?

12:01.320 --> 12:02.820
I noticed something strange with the rope,

12:02.820 --> 12:03.820
so I came to check.

12:04.980 --> 12:06.740
You were worried I might be in danger.

12:06.740 --> 12:07.190
No,

12:07.500 --> 12:09.900
you were worried
my face might be in danger.

12:13.790 --> 12:15.540
Earlier, Flower Lady ran away,

12:15.580 --> 12:17.150
and I came out with Li to look for it.

12:17.150 --> 12:18.220
He said he was in the forest

12:18.220 --> 12:19.680
and encountered a couple,

12:19.740 --> 12:20.960
whom he frightened.

12:21.070 --> 12:21.960
He was talking

12:22.190 --> 12:23.590
about you two, wasn't he?

12:27.670 --> 12:29.280
Since we've found the person,

12:29.280 --> 12:30.080
let's go back.

12:31.150 --> 12:32.080
Why such a hurry?

12:32.310 --> 12:32.820
Why?

12:33.460 --> 12:35.570
I came to this place by my own choice.

12:35.740 --> 12:36.980
Li knows medicine

12:36.980 --> 12:38.440
and can heal my eyes.

12:38.910 --> 12:40.150
In just a few more days,

12:40.150 --> 12:41.950
my eyes will be able to see again.

12:42.190 --> 12:44.030
Please tell my parents

12:44.100 --> 12:46.550
that there's a very nice person
taking care of me

12:46.550 --> 12:48.010
and they shouldn't worry.

12:50.820 --> 12:52.020
You don't believe me?

12:52.430 --> 12:53.820
Let me take you to Li

12:53.820 --> 12:55.530
so he can tell you himself.

12:59.910 --> 13:00.510
Which way?

13:01.270 --> 13:01.800
This way.

13:02.220 --> 13:02.750
Let's go.

13:03.270 --> 13:03.700
Wait.

13:04.100 --> 13:04.620
Ignore him.

13:04.620 --> 13:05.190
Let's go.

13:08.460 --> 13:09.860
Every plant and tree here

13:09.980 --> 13:11.320
is Li's friend.

13:23.460 --> 13:25.060
We're here. It's right here.

13:25.790 --> 13:26.320
Let's go.

13:31.050 --> 13:32.310
I know you're annoyed.

13:34.780 --> 13:35.440
Li.

13:44.980 --> 13:46.680
Li, we have visitors.

13:51.500 --> 13:52.090
Li.

13:56.150 --> 13:56.910
Li.

13:58.190 --> 13:59.310
He was just here

13:59.400 --> 14:00.730
but now he's gone again.

14:04.950 --> 14:05.950
Don't touch that!

14:07.550 --> 14:08.130
Li.

14:09.100 --> 14:10.980
I brought two friends to see you.

14:11.390 --> 14:13.190
My parents noticed I was missing

14:13.340 --> 14:15.800
and got worried,
so they sent them to find me.

14:18.150 --> 14:19.550
Why are you wearing a mask again?

14:19.550 --> 14:21.610
Didn't we agree you wouldn't wear it?

14:24.390 --> 14:25.180
Flower Lady.

14:27.530 --> 14:28.460
Don't be scared.

14:29.500 --> 14:30.430
Don't be scared.

14:35.580 --> 14:36.220
Thank you.

14:41.090 --> 14:41.970
Can't you see?

14:43.310 --> 14:44.270
I've been blind since childhood.

14:44.270 --> 14:45.470
I can't see anything.

14:51.700 --> 14:52.790
What happened

14:52.860 --> 14:53.590
to your hand?

14:54.550 --> 14:55.220
My hand...

14:56.980 --> 14:57.520
is gone.

15:01.580 --> 15:02.690
You're so pitiful.

15:06.270 --> 15:07.750
Let me touch your face.

15:10.460 --> 15:11.460
I should at least know

15:11.460 --> 15:14.190
what the person
who saved Flower Lady looks like.

15:25.550 --> 15:26.070
Why...

15:27.390 --> 15:28.840
Why do you wear a mask?

15:31.550 --> 15:32.300
I'm ugly.

15:33.950 --> 15:34.930
I can't see.

15:35.150 --> 15:37.480
You don't need to wear
a mask in front of me.

15:50.310 --> 15:52.550
What's your name?

15:52.910 --> 15:53.430
Li.

15:54.310 --> 15:54.860
Li.

15:55.670 --> 15:56.600
My name is Yunyi.

15:57.550 --> 15:59.790
My parents always say
it's dangerous outside.

15:59.790 --> 16:01.520
They never let me go out to play.

16:01.700 --> 16:03.960
This time they brought me to Pingjiang,

16:04.070 --> 16:06.200
but I'm still trapped indoors all day.

16:07.070 --> 16:07.620
Li.

16:08.310 --> 16:09.650
Take me out to play.

16:10.270 --> 16:11.740
Otherwise, when my parents wake up,

16:11.740 --> 16:13.400
I won't be able to go out again.

16:13.860 --> 16:15.450
Li, please,

16:15.670 --> 16:16.730
take me out to play.

16:18.430 --> 16:20.090
This place feels so different

16:20.100 --> 16:21.800
from where I live.

16:28.390 --> 16:29.390
It smells so nice.

16:42.310 --> 16:42.970
Old Pagoda.

16:43.460 --> 16:44.720
You tripped my friend.

16:47.030 --> 16:48.560
Is there someone else here?

16:49.430 --> 16:51.560
Old Pagoda is this big tree beside you,

16:52.100 --> 16:53.300
an old friend of mine.

16:54.310 --> 16:54.970
Then,

16:55.030 --> 16:57.150
take me to greet your old friend.

16:57.700 --> 16:58.230
Let's go.

17:14.589 --> 17:16.770
Your good friend must be very tall,

17:17.150 --> 17:17.810
very big,

17:18.670 --> 17:21.200
with many birds
making homes in its branches.

17:22.260 --> 17:23.420
From now on,

17:23.670 --> 17:24.369
Old Pagoda,

17:24.430 --> 17:25.890
you're my good friend too.

17:36.260 --> 17:38.750
It seems like it's talking.

17:41.060 --> 17:42.110
It says your eyes

17:42.780 --> 17:43.780
can actually see.

17:44.350 --> 17:45.030
Really?

17:48.960 --> 17:51.020
You can understand what it's saying?

17:51.300 --> 17:52.060
It also says

17:52.670 --> 17:53.670
you just need the first dewdrop

17:53.670 --> 17:56.070
from the forest at sunrise
to wash your eyes

17:56.390 --> 17:58.430
for half a month continuously,
and you'll be cured.

17:58.430 --> 17:59.390
That means

17:59.630 --> 18:01.560
I can hang out here for half a month.

18:01.700 --> 18:02.520
Great!

18:02.630 --> 18:03.640
Your family will be worried.

18:03.640 --> 18:04.430
It's fine.

18:04.430 --> 18:05.630
My parents are usually very busy.

18:05.630 --> 18:07.110
They don't have time for me.

18:07.110 --> 18:07.820
Besides,

18:07.950 --> 18:09.590
if my eyes are really cured,

18:09.590 --> 18:10.850
they'll be overjoyed.

18:13.750 --> 18:14.220
Good.

18:15.570 --> 18:18.110
From now on,
come with me daily to collect morning dew.

18:18.110 --> 18:18.960
Wonderful!

18:19.700 --> 18:21.330
If my eyes really heal,

18:21.540 --> 18:23.260
I'll see my parents with my own eyes,

18:23.260 --> 18:24.190
then look at you,

18:24.300 --> 18:27.160
and see all the beautiful sights
in this vast world.

18:29.110 --> 18:31.270
Your face must be good looking,

18:31.350 --> 18:32.880
but you always wear a mask.

18:33.220 --> 18:34.460
Since the first time I met you,

18:34.460 --> 18:35.790
you've been wearing it.

18:37.950 --> 18:39.310
Xiao Yao, Hong Ye,

18:39.590 --> 18:40.540
please tell me,

18:40.740 --> 18:42.870
is Li's face good looking?

18:46.500 --> 18:47.120
Yes, it is.

18:48.540 --> 18:49.430
I knew it.

18:49.740 --> 18:52.000
Yunyi, go sit in the sunshine for a while.

18:52.300 --> 18:53.390
It will be good for your eyes.

18:53.390 --> 18:53.850
Mm-hmm.

18:56.110 --> 18:57.260
Xiao Yao, come on.

18:57.740 --> 18:59.400
I'll take you to have some fun.

18:59.590 --> 19:00.120
Let's go.

19:15.430 --> 19:16.090
Demon King.

19:19.190 --> 19:20.590
You are the mountain elf.

19:21.500 --> 19:23.160
Did you kill the human ladies

19:24.150 --> 19:25.140
by the lake?

19:25.220 --> 19:25.790
No.

19:26.590 --> 19:27.480
Who did then?

19:27.590 --> 19:28.840
Find out yourself.

19:31.220 --> 19:32.350
You're a Demon King.

19:33.110 --> 19:34.640
Why did you come to my forest

19:34.950 --> 19:35.950
these many times?

19:36.060 --> 19:38.590
I'm here to look
for that little girl just now.

19:40.150 --> 19:41.010
A demon like you

19:41.920 --> 19:43.580
is meddling in human affairs?

19:47.300 --> 19:48.830
Why do you

19:49.740 --> 19:50.670
keep her here?

19:51.060 --> 19:52.040
To heal her eyes.

19:52.350 --> 19:55.810
Do you know she's the only daughter
of Qionghua's sect leader?

19:56.430 --> 19:59.300
Years ago,
all major sects and the Feiyu Guard

19:59.980 --> 20:01.510
nearly wiped out your kind.

20:02.500 --> 20:04.190
Do you truly want to heal her?

20:07.430 --> 20:08.190
I did this

20:10.020 --> 20:11.150
to atone for my sins.

20:14.630 --> 20:16.630
The mountain elf is born of revenge.

20:17.430 --> 20:18.960
What is this atonement for?

20:20.670 --> 20:21.870
My father once said,

20:23.540 --> 20:25.670
the Yuli Spring is the tears of demons.

20:26.590 --> 20:28.290
What you call immortality

20:28.950 --> 20:30.590
is just endless suffering.

20:32.420 --> 20:33.060
For revenge,

20:33.060 --> 20:35.790
I swallowed the mud
containing Yuli Spring water

20:36.110 --> 20:37.570
and became a mountain elf,

20:38.300 --> 20:39.830
killing countless people.

20:40.980 --> 20:43.510
But I suffered the backlash
of my inner demon.

20:44.010 --> 20:45.540
I'm neither dead nor alive;

20:46.910 --> 20:48.710
neither alive nor destroyed...

20:52.060 --> 20:53.390
suffering unbearably.

20:53.710 --> 20:56.720
[Temple of Eternal Life]

21:23.280 --> 21:25.260
We should pay respects at this temple too.

21:25.260 --> 21:26.470
Go get the offerings.

21:26.740 --> 21:27.630
Yes, madam.

21:37.110 --> 21:40.850
Madam, this temple has been abandoned
for over a decade.

21:41.150 --> 21:43.950
The deity's true form
has probably long departed.

21:44.220 --> 21:44.870
Why don't

21:44.870 --> 21:47.130
we go to the Yanhua Temple ahead instead?

21:47.430 --> 21:48.340
I made a vow

21:48.430 --> 21:50.140
to worship at every temple I encounter.

21:50.140 --> 21:51.740
You don't need to come in with me.

21:51.740 --> 21:52.930
Clean up the rest.

21:53.020 --> 21:53.430
Yes.

22:48.130 --> 22:50.960
♪ Cliffside streams flow, pine scents
fill my sleeves as I sleep ♪

22:52.480 --> 22:55.500
♪ What year will cranes return?
The moss covers another tower ♪

22:56.990 --> 22:59.250
♪ Brew iced moon springs,
the stone pot brims with sunset glows ♪

23:00.580 --> 23:02.650
[Temple of Eternal Life]

23:00.770 --> 23:03.400
♪ Wind sweeps the empty court;
writing the seasons ♪

23:05.300 --> 23:08.040
♪ When wind breaks the best tree,
the swan grows thin with grief ♪

23:09.620 --> 23:12.350
♪ On the mountains, there's a monologue
in the mountains ♪

23:13.910 --> 23:16.800
♪ Drunk in the pavilion,
vines climb up my sleeves ♪

23:18.130 --> 23:20.530
♪ Smiling with an empty cup;
this heart is the harbor ♪

23:21.250 --> 23:24.210
[Lv Zelin] [Ding Kaizheng]

23:24.410 --> 23:27.550
♪ Cool dew freezes the day,
mist and rain veil the drifting boat ♪

23:28.690 --> 23:31.720
♪ Eternal night won't stay, but thankfully
there are memories to keep ♪

23:33.130 --> 23:35.900
♪ Moon shifts stars, wind stirs
curtains at the window ♪

23:37.420 --> 23:40.250
♪ Waiting only for a glance
from you in this lifetime ♪

23:43.820 --> 23:50.250
[Lv Zelin] [Ding Kaizheng]

24:01.950 --> 24:03.540
Thank you, Buddha,
for your great kindness.

24:03.110 --> 24:05.820
♪ Cliffside streams flow, pine scents
fill my sleeves as I sleep ♪

24:03.590 --> 24:05.870
I will be leaving this place today,

24:06.390 --> 24:07.780
but I will continue to pray often.

24:07.410 --> 24:10.040
♪ What year will cranes return?
The moss covers another tower ♪

24:11.790 --> 24:14.360
♪ Brew iced moon springs,
the stone pot brims with sunset glows ♪

24:15.870 --> 24:18.560
♪ Wind sweeps the empty court;
writing the seasons ♪

24:20.350 --> 24:23.100
♪ When wind breaks the best tree,
the swan grows thin with grief ♪

24:24.560 --> 24:27.320
♪ On the mountains, there's a monologue
in the mountains ♪

24:28.910 --> 24:31.630
♪ Drunk in the pavilion,
vines climb up my sleeves ♪

24:32.980 --> 24:35.710
♪ Smiling with an empty cup;
this heart is the harbor ♪

24:37.390 --> 24:40.430
♪ Cool dew freezes the day,
mist and rain veil the drifting boat ♪

24:41.750 --> 24:44.860
♪ Eternal night won't stay, but thankfully
there are memories to keep ♪

24:46.210 --> 24:49.120
♪ Moon shifts stars, wind stirs
curtains at the window ♪

24:47.830 --> 24:48.950
Why did you save me?

24:50.260 --> 24:53.190
♪ Waiting only for a glance
from you in this lifetime ♪

24:52.110 --> 24:53.600
I have never saved anyone.

24:53.910 --> 24:55.450
Your life was saved by Buddha.

24:54.500 --> 24:56.980
♪ Holding your hand, we watch
the shifting stars together ♪

24:56.110 --> 24:57.910
You ate the offerings

24:58.150 --> 25:01.060
♪ I brew years of romance
and longing into wine ♪

24:58.500 --> 24:59.830
and planted good karma.

25:01.300 --> 25:02.980
But I've been living in a daze
these 10 years,

25:02.260 --> 25:06.110
♪ Holding your hand, we roam free
and happy together ♪

25:04.300 --> 25:05.780
despised wherever I go.

25:07.400 --> 25:09.990
♪ Eternal sorrows end, the broken cocoon
becomes an ark ♪

25:07.830 --> 25:09.830
Even the street dogs look down on me.

25:11.160 --> 25:13.970
♪ Holding your hand, we watch
the shifting stars together ♪

25:11.260 --> 25:12.060
Only you

25:13.150 --> 25:14.350
have never feared me,

25:14.980 --> 25:15.910
never despised me,

25:15.130 --> 25:18.240
♪ I boil away my worries
with dew and strands of hair ♪

25:17.390 --> 25:18.590
and even pitied me...

25:19.280 --> 25:23.320
♪ Holding your hand, we roam free
and happy together ♪

25:20.020 --> 25:20.950
and cared for me.

25:22.670 --> 25:23.810
Live well.

25:24.590 --> 25:27.800
♪ Three lives of joy,
growing old with one heart ♪

25:26.020 --> 25:27.550
What's the point of living?

25:29.740 --> 25:30.800
If life is endless,

25:31.870 --> 25:33.600
then suffering is endless too.

25:35.060 --> 25:35.990
My heart is dead.

25:37.390 --> 25:39.980
What's good in living?

25:41.350 --> 25:42.500
You live

25:42.870 --> 25:44.130
so that you can

25:45.260 --> 25:47.460
resolve the evil karma you've planted.

25:56.390 --> 25:57.630
May I see your face?

26:25.020 --> 26:25.910
Since then,

26:27.390 --> 26:28.790
I haven't killed anyone.

26:33.260 --> 26:34.590
I've been saving people

26:35.630 --> 26:37.490
and helping them find salvation.

26:38.590 --> 26:40.430
By the time Yunyi can see again,

26:41.630 --> 26:42.830
the people I've saved

26:43.520 --> 26:44.630
will number 1,000.

26:47.260 --> 26:48.520
You killed a thousand,

26:49.220 --> 26:50.420
but saved a thousand.

26:51.830 --> 26:52.690
Have you let go?

26:58.870 --> 26:59.980
Don't worry.

26:59.980 --> 27:01.740
Li just speaks harshly sometimes,

27:01.740 --> 27:02.950
but he's a good person.

27:02.950 --> 27:04.540
He never fights with others.

27:04.540 --> 27:06.340
Don't worry about your beloved.

27:08.110 --> 27:09.630
He's not my beloved.

27:11.020 --> 27:12.860
Though I'm blind,

27:12.950 --> 27:15.090
my heart sees more clearly than yours.

27:15.590 --> 27:16.920
He's very similar to Li:

27:17.060 --> 27:18.770
cold on the surface,

27:18.980 --> 27:20.640
but his heart cares about you.

27:23.700 --> 27:24.590
He just thinks

27:24.590 --> 27:26.450
I look like someone from his past.

27:27.150 --> 27:28.220
If he truly cared,

27:28.870 --> 27:31.190
how could he say hurtful things
so casually?

27:31.190 --> 27:32.190
When he hurts you,

27:32.260 --> 27:34.460
perhaps he feels even worse than you do.

27:34.630 --> 27:35.700
Like when I was little

27:35.700 --> 27:37.030
and almost hurt myself,

27:37.260 --> 27:39.660
mother beat me severely
when she found out.

27:39.780 --> 27:42.040
But then she cried even harder than I did.

27:46.390 --> 27:48.020
Are you really not coming back with us?

27:48.020 --> 27:49.670
My eyes will heal soon.

27:49.780 --> 27:51.270
I can't give up now.

27:56.780 --> 27:57.670
This is the longevity lock

27:57.670 --> 27:59.590
my parents made for me personally.

27:59.590 --> 28:01.650
There's no other like it in the world.

28:01.670 --> 28:02.910
Give it to my parents,

28:02.960 --> 28:04.820
and they'll believe what you say.

28:09.460 --> 28:10.520
That's not enough?

28:11.350 --> 28:12.480
Then how about this:

28:15.980 --> 28:17.640
take Flower Lady back with you

28:17.700 --> 28:19.160
and let my mother feed her.

28:19.190 --> 28:21.190
Now they should believe you, right?

28:37.190 --> 28:38.060
Still angry?

28:40.460 --> 28:42.120
You haven't even apologized.

28:42.150 --> 28:43.950
Why should I speak kindly to you?

28:50.540 --> 28:51.140
I'm sorry.

28:53.220 --> 28:54.420
What did you do wrong?

28:55.110 --> 28:55.970
My mistake was

28:56.830 --> 28:58.030
not having the chance

28:58.350 --> 28:59.950
to tell you what I want to say.

29:00.870 --> 29:01.460
Go ahead.

29:03.220 --> 29:05.750
I know you and Ning'an
are not the same person.

29:05.950 --> 29:07.550
That day in the Misty Forest,

29:08.220 --> 29:11.020
I dispelled Ning'an's illusion
with my own hands.

29:11.870 --> 29:13.180
At that moment, I knew

29:14.150 --> 29:16.480
the past had become like drifting clouds.

29:17.950 --> 29:19.190
And now before me

29:20.740 --> 29:21.260
is you,

29:22.670 --> 29:23.200
Xiao Yao.

29:23.700 --> 29:25.360
Whether you say it or not,

29:25.390 --> 29:27.070
I am not that princess.

29:27.300 --> 29:27.950
I know.

29:29.350 --> 29:30.550
I just want to tell you

29:31.020 --> 29:31.750
I protect you

29:33.060 --> 29:34.590
not because of anyone else.

29:42.390 --> 29:42.950
From now on, don't

29:42.950 --> 29:44.880
compare me to that princess again.

29:45.350 --> 29:46.680
I don't like hearing it.

29:46.780 --> 29:47.380
All right.

29:50.590 --> 29:51.390
Say it again.

29:53.870 --> 29:54.470
All right.

30:04.500 --> 30:05.250
You said

30:05.740 --> 30:07.540
Yunyi doesn't want to come back?

30:07.910 --> 30:08.260
Yes.

30:08.700 --> 30:10.430
Her eyes will heal in a few days.

30:10.630 --> 30:12.350
She wants to wait
until her eyes are better

30:12.350 --> 30:15.080
to come back
and see her parents with her own eyes.

30:15.150 --> 30:16.260
Nonsense!

30:17.220 --> 30:18.820
My daughter was born blind.

30:19.300 --> 30:21.230
I've searched for the best doctors

30:21.740 --> 30:23.070
but none could cure her.

30:23.460 --> 30:26.020
You think you can fool us with just a cat?

30:26.740 --> 30:27.340
Oh, right.

30:28.260 --> 30:29.290
She also gave me this.

30:29.290 --> 30:32.020
She said you would believe me
if I showed you this.

30:40.110 --> 30:41.920
Is my daughter dead?

30:42.950 --> 30:44.990
Where have you hidden her body?

30:45.110 --> 30:45.590
Tell me!

30:49.910 --> 30:52.380
You keep saying your daughter is dead.

30:52.740 --> 30:54.390
Don't you want her to be alive?

30:54.390 --> 30:54.860
You...

30:55.220 --> 30:55.670
Stop!

31:01.500 --> 31:02.110
Stop!

31:06.950 --> 31:07.750
Miss Xiao Yao.

31:08.390 --> 31:10.590
From your description of her behavior,

31:10.740 --> 31:12.830
it is indeed my daughter Yunyi,
without a doubt.

31:12.830 --> 31:13.630
I believe you.

31:19.780 --> 31:21.350
When her eyes are healed,

31:21.430 --> 31:23.350
we can go bring her back, can't we?

31:35.830 --> 31:37.110
He has never liked cats.

31:37.110 --> 31:38.170
It doesn't matter.

31:38.240 --> 31:38.940
Let's go.

31:54.540 --> 31:55.610
Now do you believe

31:55.830 --> 31:57.360
Hong Ye is not the murderer?

32:00.430 --> 32:02.300
Whether you believe it or not
is not my problem.

32:02.300 --> 32:05.230
Catching the killer
is the Feiyu Guard's job anyway.

32:05.540 --> 32:08.270
But I hope
you won't implicate the innocent

32:09.060 --> 32:11.110
and can help prevent more
young women in Pingjiang

32:11.110 --> 32:12.440
from dying needlessly.

32:13.150 --> 32:14.830
The city gates have been closed for days.

32:14.830 --> 32:16.940
Citizens keep
their doors and windows shut.

32:16.940 --> 32:18.630
The Feiyu Guard patrols day and night.

32:18.630 --> 32:20.290
No one else will die unjustly.

32:21.460 --> 32:23.020
If the city gates remain closed,

32:23.020 --> 32:24.670
won't people starve to death?

32:24.670 --> 32:26.460
True. People fear starvation,

32:26.870 --> 32:28.130
and so does the killer.

32:29.500 --> 32:30.500
You mean...

32:31.150 --> 32:32.950
As long as he still craves blood,

32:33.150 --> 32:35.590
he'll eventually slip up
and reveal himself.

32:35.590 --> 32:37.320
So what we need to do now is to...

32:38.300 --> 32:38.780
Wait.

32:58.740 --> 33:00.070
Lower your voice.

33:00.340 --> 33:02.300
Don't let everyone in Pingjiang know

33:02.300 --> 33:03.700
you killed those people.

33:29.350 --> 33:29.980
I'm here.

33:31.700 --> 33:33.500
Thank you for escorting me back.

33:36.700 --> 33:37.260
Xiao Yao.

33:38.750 --> 33:40.210
The city is still not safe.

33:40.540 --> 33:41.740
Stay safe.

33:42.910 --> 33:43.670
Of course.

33:44.590 --> 33:46.220
I hope you can find the killer soon

33:46.220 --> 33:48.020
and restore Pingjiang's peace.

33:49.060 --> 33:49.870
Of course.

34:11.659 --> 34:12.230
Tan'er.

34:13.830 --> 34:15.690
Hong Ye is clearly in there.

34:16.659 --> 34:18.719
Why won't you come out of your sheath?

34:21.460 --> 34:23.860
Don't tell me
you've taken a liking to that—

34:24.350 --> 34:25.150
Just kidding.

34:25.460 --> 34:26.260
Just kidding.

34:32.949 --> 34:34.409
That Feiyu Guard has left?

34:36.620 --> 34:37.130
Mm-hmm.

34:40.980 --> 34:43.310
He didn't want to chat with you
any longer?

34:46.350 --> 34:46.949
He did.

34:52.030 --> 34:54.030
But there was nothing to talk about.

34:56.659 --> 34:58.260
The wine from the human realm

34:58.430 --> 34:59.690
is quite interesting.

35:01.230 --> 35:02.290
I am the Demon Lord,

35:03.180 --> 35:04.270
above all demons.

35:06.020 --> 35:07.750
Similar to your human emperor.

35:08.830 --> 35:09.830
I may seem noble,

35:10.460 --> 35:11.860
but I'm actually lonely.

35:13.270 --> 35:15.530
I have no friends to drink with.

35:19.430 --> 35:21.710
Isn't it just that you don't trust others?

35:21.710 --> 35:22.640
You make it sound

35:23.350 --> 35:24.390
so fancy.

35:26.500 --> 35:28.180
I've been sincere before,

35:30.430 --> 35:32.030
and have trusted people too.

35:33.470 --> 35:34.320
But in the end,

35:35.620 --> 35:37.960
it became a weapon for others to hurt me.

35:38.950 --> 35:39.910
Since then,

35:41.980 --> 35:43.980
I've been unwilling to trust again.

35:45.830 --> 35:46.980
I thought I had

35:47.790 --> 35:49.050
become cold-hearted.

35:51.350 --> 35:52.060
Until...

35:55.350 --> 35:57.550
Until every moment after you appeared.

35:59.710 --> 36:01.970
Your protection of me in front of humans,

36:03.140 --> 36:04.340
your understanding,

36:05.430 --> 36:07.090
your sincerity to the demons,

36:07.350 --> 36:08.350
your kindness...

36:09.980 --> 36:11.710
They all made me unconsciously

36:12.140 --> 36:13.140
feel your warmth.

36:15.530 --> 36:18.480
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my love and hatred ♪

36:18.620 --> 36:19.910
You always told me

36:19.630 --> 36:22.070
♪ Together, we explore
mountains and rivers with one heart ♪

36:22.990 --> 36:26.280
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my dreams and my drinks ♪

36:23.390 --> 36:25.050
you wanted me to trust others.

36:26.580 --> 36:27.710
But I

36:27.560 --> 36:31.530
♪ With an extra pair of eyes, we
admire the sun, moon, and stars together ♪

36:29.100 --> 36:30.020
can only

36:31.430 --> 36:32.030
trust you.

36:35.040 --> 36:37.760
♪ A thousand years have flowed by ♪

36:39.270 --> 36:41.410
♪ Turning into tears
that brim over my eyes ♪

36:41.870 --> 36:42.910
So

36:42.910 --> 36:45.060
♪ And the moonlight to heal sorrow ♪

36:43.750 --> 36:47.750
I am your trusted

36:46.300 --> 36:49.150
♪ The sweetness of the world
always tastes like the first time ♪

36:48.980 --> 36:49.830
friend?

36:50.260 --> 36:53.280
♪ The joys and sorrows in my dreams ♪

36:52.350 --> 36:53.540
My only friend.

36:54.490 --> 36:56.850
♪ Transformed into a farewell song,
stirring the soul ♪

36:58.280 --> 37:00.530
♪ And into wind and rain,
drifting and swirling ♪

37:01.650 --> 37:03.900
♪ The ship of fate
always faces the waves ♪

37:05.170 --> 37:08.240
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my love and hatred ♪

37:07.980 --> 37:08.510
Alright.

37:08.950 --> 37:11.140
Then get drunk with me,

37:09.240 --> 37:11.810
♪ Together, we explore
mountains and rivers with one heart ♪

37:11.310 --> 37:12.310
your only friend.

37:12.600 --> 37:15.860
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my dreams and my drinks ♪

37:15.660 --> 37:18.230
I've never been drunk before,

37:16.920 --> 37:19.140
♪ With an extra pair of eyes, we
admire the sun, moon, and stars together ♪

37:19.790 --> 37:21.540
You still don't believe
I can hold my liquor?

37:20.240 --> 37:23.300
♪ From now on, the moon fears waning,
the waves long for the returning tide ♪

37:21.540 --> 37:22.430
Let me tell you,

37:22.430 --> 37:24.390
even my father can't outdrink me.

37:24.410 --> 37:26.870
♪ I carry an extra touch of care
in my heart and on my brow ♪

37:26.460 --> 37:26.980
Yeah.

37:27.350 --> 37:28.250
I see now.

37:27.690 --> 37:31.020
♪ From now on,
with reckless courage and mutual longing ♪

37:28.710 --> 37:29.950
You really can drink.

37:32.270 --> 37:37.330
♪ We forsake three lifetimes of marriage,
only to fulfill our wishes ♪

37:33.100 --> 37:34.180
Let me tell you,

37:35.620 --> 37:36.900
when I was young,

37:37.140 --> 37:41.460
the walls in our home were so drafty.

37:42.180 --> 37:46.980
We used just a thin piece of cloth

37:47.620 --> 37:48.710
as a blanket.

37:50.500 --> 37:52.180
When cold, I'd wrap it tight,

37:52.950 --> 37:54.210
but it still felt cold.

37:54.910 --> 37:56.440
When there was no other way,

37:56.830 --> 37:58.890
my father would take me out drinking.

37:58.990 --> 38:01.660
♪ The joys and sorrows in my dreams ♪

38:00.580 --> 38:01.830
One sip,

38:02.180 --> 38:03.460
and my whole body would warm up.

38:02.870 --> 38:05.460
♪ Transformed into a farewell song,
stirring the soul ♪

38:05.460 --> 38:09.230
A pot of wine can keep me warm

38:06.640 --> 38:09.050
♪ And into wind and rain,
drifting and swirling ♪

38:10.460 --> 38:11.390
for two days.

38:10.490 --> 38:12.490
♪ The ship of fate
always faces the waves ♪

38:13.020 --> 38:14.430
If I hadn't sneaked some sips,

38:13.630 --> 38:16.660
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my love and hatred ♪

38:14.910 --> 38:16.790
it could have lasted another day.

38:17.740 --> 38:20.300
♪ Together, we explore
mountains and rivers with one heart ♪

38:20.960 --> 38:24.380
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my dreams and my drinks ♪

38:22.390 --> 38:23.710
Now it's better.

38:25.430 --> 38:28.020
Now I don't worry about
not having money anymore.

38:25.480 --> 38:27.600
♪ With an extra pair of eyes, we
admire the sun, moon, and stars together ♪

38:28.810 --> 38:32.010
♪ From now on, the moon fears waning,
the waves long for the returning tide ♪

38:30.350 --> 38:32.140
I have so much money.

38:32.140 --> 38:33.690
Look, all of this is money!

38:33.040 --> 38:35.510
♪ I carry an extra touch of care
in my heart and on my brow ♪

38:35.140 --> 38:35.980
Look!

38:36.290 --> 38:39.560
♪ From now on,
with reckless courage and mutual longing ♪

38:36.500 --> 38:37.830
All of these are money!

38:38.100 --> 38:39.430
All my money!

38:40.750 --> 38:42.980
I have so much money now!

38:40.980 --> 38:46.270
♪ Giving up three lives of marriage
just for ♪

38:47.950 --> 38:48.870
Before,

38:49.430 --> 38:52.540
I thought the most miserable thing in life

38:50.580 --> 38:55.230
♪ Our wishes ♪

38:52.540 --> 38:54.410
was having no money.

38:55.020 --> 38:55.750
Now,

38:56.660 --> 38:58.090
I have money.

38:58.540 --> 38:59.270
But

39:02.140 --> 39:03.980
I've become a demon.

39:08.230 --> 39:10.820
How did I become a demon?

39:12.540 --> 39:15.870
And you are forcing me
to learn demonic arts.

39:17.100 --> 39:20.010
I get beaten when I fall asleep.

39:20.790 --> 39:23.210
I'm tainted with demonic energy now too.

39:24.790 --> 39:28.780
I probably can't return
to the human realm anymore.

39:43.500 --> 39:44.230
Xiao Yao.

39:47.270 --> 39:48.000
But!

39:49.100 --> 39:51.140
I can create money now.

39:51.910 --> 39:54.020
I'll create lots and lots

39:54.020 --> 39:55.350
of them!

39:55.950 --> 39:58.410
I want to give it to my father.

39:58.980 --> 40:01.500
This is the best demonic art I've learned.

40:07.100 --> 40:07.540
You!

40:08.350 --> 40:09.350
The one drinking!

40:12.310 --> 40:12.750
Smile.

40:15.540 --> 40:17.500
If you smile nicely,

40:18.180 --> 40:18.750
you can

40:19.230 --> 40:19.830
have this.

40:39.180 --> 40:40.940
Why aren't you smiling?

40:46.180 --> 40:46.980
This face

40:48.620 --> 40:51.310
is one of a kind.

40:52.060 --> 40:53.660
So beautiful.

40:55.280 --> 40:55.950
Don't move.

40:57.580 --> 40:58.620
This angle.

41:00.120 --> 41:03.350
♪ Fear that the red thread that bound us,
the vows we engraved ♪

41:00.140 --> 41:00.800
Don't move!

41:01.710 --> 41:03.340
This profile.

41:03.970 --> 41:05.020
-Xiao Yao.
-Don't move

41:04.350 --> 41:07.710
♪ The "forever" we swore are
meant to miss their mark ♪

41:06.980 --> 41:09.020
I've seen it countless times,

41:14.060 --> 41:17.400
♪ Afraid of the exchanged life and death,
the arrows blocking the way ♪

41:18.330 --> 41:22.640
♪ The chains that are hard to break,
hard to distinguish ♪

41:22.910 --> 41:28.270
but never looked at it like this before.

41:25.940 --> 41:28.260
♪ Perhaps it's all for nothing ♪

41:29.310 --> 41:31.900
♪ Love and hate are nothing more ♪

41:32.670 --> 41:37.010
♪ Than a scene we rush through ♪

41:36.750 --> 41:37.580
Don't move...

41:40.280 --> 41:42.480
♪ Afraid of giving my true heart ♪

41:43.740 --> 41:46.070
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

41:48.390 --> 41:50.520
♪ Boiling hot ♪

41:49.950 --> 41:51.460
Can I move now?

41:55.300 --> 41:59.590
♪ You and I are like grass and trees
meeting in the depths of the clouds ♪

42:00.510 --> 42:04.670
♪ Like the red thread strung together,
hanging on a sharp sword ♪

42:05.760 --> 42:08.590
♪ Waiting for the heartbeat
to shatter time ♪

42:09.800 --> 42:11.260
♪ The chains of fate ♪

42:12.260 --> 42:15.770
♪ Belong to us, in the blink of an eye,
it's 1,000 years ♪

42:16.790 --> 42:20.390
♪ You and I meet across mountains
and rivers, under the bright moon ♪

42:21.240 --> 42:22.730
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

42:23.710 --> 42:25.180
♪ Both flushing ♪

42:26.210 --> 42:29.750
♪ Waiting to walk hand in hand
through the chessboard of fate ♪

42:30.870 --> 42:35.920
♪ The carefree moments that belong to us ♪

42:37.950 --> 42:40.230
♪ Moments ♪
